sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Borrower
  participant DApp
  participant Oracle
  participant Registry as Mock Registry
  participant Prover as Groth16 Prover
  participant PV
  participant CV
  participant L
  participant Officer as Loan Officer

  Borrower->>DApp: Select property and principal
  DApp->>Oracle: POST /verify
  Oracle->>Registry: Load record
  Oracle->>PV: setVerified(...)
  DApp->>Oracle: POST /compliance
  Oracle->>Prover: Generate proof
  Oracle->>CV: verifyProofAndSetCompliance(...)
  CV->>PV: Read verification and commitment
  CV->>PV: setCompliant(...)
  Borrower->>L: requestLoan(...)
  Officer->>L: approveLoan(loanId)
  L->>PV: isVerified + isCompliantFor
  Borrower->>L: repay(loanId)
